        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-(--crit-fg-secondary) leading-relaxed mb-6 max-sm:text-base">
          See what&rsquo;s in flight, who&rsquo;s waiting on whom, and where agents have replied &mdash;
          without context-switching between Slack, the CLI, and three browser tabs.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3.5">
          <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
            <span class="text-(--crit-brand) mt-0.5">
